{{!
    Confirmation cards of a proposed change, shown in the side pane before the user confirms it:
    per action a title, a one-line summary and a table of the values that will be set.

    Rendered by aiinstructions.js (preview type proposed_action).

    @template bookingextension_agent/proposed_action

    @package    bookingextension_agent
    @copyright  2026 Wunderbyte GmbH <info@wunderbyte.at>
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Context variables required for this template:
    * actions - List of proposed actions, each with:
      * title - Card title (may be empty).
      * summary - One-line summary (may be empty).
      * hasrows - Whether the action has value rows.
      * rows - List of value rows, each with label and value.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "actions": [
            {
                "title": "Create course",
                "summary": "A new course is created.",
                "hasrows": true,
                "rows": [
                    {"label": "Full name", "value": "Test course"},
                    {"label": "Short name", "value": "TEST"}
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#actions}}
<div class="booking-ai-proposed-action card mb-2">
    <div class="card-body p-3">
        {{#title}}<h6 class="mb-2">{{title}}</h6>{{/title}}
        {{#summary}}<p class="text-muted small mb-2">{{summary}}</p>{{/summary}}
        {{#hasrows}}
        <table class="table table-sm mb-0">
            <tbody>
                {{#rows}}
                <tr>
                    <th class="font-weight-normal text-muted pr-3 align-top">{{label}}</th>
                    <td>{{value}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/rows}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/hasrows}}
    </div>
</div>
{{/actions}}
